OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephen's with an afternoon
OL,7,     Fof specially recorded music,
OL,8,     Fincluding concertos from two of
OL,9,     Ftoday's foremost clarinettists and
OL,10,     Fhighlights from the recent
OL,11,     FHay-on-Wye festival.
OL,12,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FFrom Portsmouth Cathedral, with
OL,14,     Fmusic by Byrd, Bevan, Gibbons and
OL,15,     FBach.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,17,     F3/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,18,     Fchanging role of Purcell within
OL,19,     Fthe royal household, and the music
OL,20,     Fhe wrote for the various monarchs
OL,21,     Fwho ruled during his lifetime.
