OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSouth London drummer, producer and
OL,7,     Fbandleader Moses Boyd, sitting in
OL,8,     Ffor Soweto Kinch, spotlights some
OL,9,     Fof the new jazz releases and
OL,10,     Fclassics that he has been
OL,11,     Fenjoying.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FBarry Douglas joins the RTV
OL,14,     FSlovenia Symphony Orchestra and
OL,15,     Fconductor Lio Kuokman in
OL,16,     FTchaikovsky's first piano
OL,17,     Fconcerto. The orchestra also plays
OL,18,     Fa work by the composer Leon First.
